  en: >-
    Designing non-toxic, air-stable semiconductors that inherit what makes halide perovskites
    remarkable — without the lead.
  zhHant: 設計無毒、耐空氣的半導體材料，承襲鹵化物鈣鈦礦的優異特性，但不含鉛。
